<!--
  Every page a signed-out visitor can actually read, and nothing else.

  The list is short because the product is: the catalog, the contests and the
  profiles all sit behind the login. Nothing behind it may be listed here — a
  crawler following such a link is redirected to /login, which Search Console
  reports back as an error against the whole sitemap.

  The host must stay byte-for-byte the one in og:url (https, no www), or Search
  Console treats these as somebody else's addresses and refuses the file.

  No <lastmod>, <changefreq> or <priority>: Google ignores the last two
  outright, and a <lastmod> nobody maintains is worse than none at all.
-->
